@ 30.1.1.3.1 - Proto-Sam to Amu
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Nurse, Derek (1985), “Dentality, Areal Features, and Phonological Change in Northeastern Bantu”. In Studies of African Linguistics 16(3):243 – 279 NB: Due to the source, only changes creating dental consonants are considered here.
	{ ntç, tç } > { (n̪)t̪ʰ, t̪ }
	{ndʲ,nz} > n̪d̪